AMA's knowledge base: one markdown document per topic, each with a `title` and a `min_level`
in its frontmatter. `knowledge_sync` reads every `.md` in this folder and `knowledge_search`
answers from it, which is why this file is not markdown — anything with a `.md` suffix here
becomes a document AMA will quote. The playbook beside it syncs the folder every morning. See
"Knowledge" in docs/runbook.md, and clients/demo-practice/knowledge for two worked examples.
